  "description": "Today’s market action raised some warning signals to not ignore. I’ve decided to lock some gains, exit weaker positions and remain invested in a few other assets.",
  "body_html": "<h4><strong>Lets get the facts together:</strong></h4><ol><li><p>The S&amp;P 500 is still in a bull market. </p><ol><li><p>Price action remains above the 200 day moving average ✅</p></li><li><p>Locally, a lower low has not formed ✅</p><ol><li><p>A close below $7575 would get me to monitor more, a break below the 200 day moving average would have me close more positions. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LQDW!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe47187d1-cce3-418c-9fa7-3d01141198ed_1417x789.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LQDW!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe47187d1-cce3-418c-9fa7-3d01141198ed_1417x789.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LQDW!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe47187d1-cce3-418c-9fa7-3d01141198ed_1417x789.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LQDW!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe47187d1-cce3-418c-9fa7-3d01141198ed_1417x789.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LQDW!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe47187d1-cce3-418c-9fa7-3d01141198ed_1417x789.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LQDW!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe47187d1-cce3-418c-9fa7-3d01141198ed_1417x789.png\" width=\"1417\" height=\"789\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e47187d1-cce3-418c-9fa7-3d01141198ed_1417x789.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:789,&quot;width&quot;:1417,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:227914,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/222815028?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe47187d1-cce3-418c-9fa7-3d01141198ed_1417x789.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LQDW!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe47187d1-cce3-418c-9fa7-3d01141198ed_1417x789.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LQDW!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe47187d1-cce3-418c-9fa7-3d01141198ed_1417x789.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LQDW!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe47187d1-cce3-418c-9fa7-3d01141198ed_1417x789.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LQDW!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe47187d1-cce3-418c-9fa7-3d01141198ed_1417x789.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div></li></ol></li></ol><p></p></li><li><p>The VIX above 21, with downward price action, means I do not buy anything. </p><ol><li><p>The VIX is just volatility, sometimes it can spike and market price action actually goes up (though that is less common). You will see some goonies talking about “buying the dip” or “DCA” down. To be fair, I do think the market will recover. But, if I happen to be wrong, you are throwing money into a dumpster fire. Dip buying an DCA down is a bad habit, that burns retail investors at every real bear market. You do not need to get the bottom. When and if the market starts trending up again, we can ride the train up. VIX above 21 means I do nothing. </p></li></ol></li><li><p>Binance is getting a lot of the spotlight… but Intel is what I am watching most.  Intel, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$INTC&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>,  was a $500B+ market cap company just a few days ago, it was about ~25th place in terms of market cap. Today, it dropped 17 places and is a $340B market cap. This is a major warning signal that we need to respect, as I have covered<strong> <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/yes-i-think-a-market-meltdown-is?r=4z8lgl\">Signals I am watching for when to sell (click here)</a>. This was a massive company, that plummeted in a single day, drastically. </strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_s30!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0acb6c05-05a1-4335-a079-959ad65e00b6_1428x743.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_s30!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0acb6c05-05a1-4335-a079-959ad65e00b6_1428x743.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_s30!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0acb6c05-05a1-4335-a079-959ad65e00b6_1428x743.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_s30!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0acb6c05-05a1-4335-a079-959ad65e00b6_1428x743.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_s30!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0acb6c05-05a1-4335-a079-959ad65e00b6_1428x743.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_s30!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0acb6c05-05a1-4335-a079-959ad65e00b6_1428x743.png\" width=\"1428\" height=\"743\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/0acb6c05-05a1-4335-a079-959ad65e00b6_1428x743.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:743,&quot;width&quot;:1428,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:171099,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/222815028?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0acb6c05-05a1-4335-a079-959ad65e00b6_1428x743.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_s30!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0acb6c05-05a1-4335-a079-959ad65e00b6_1428x743.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_s30!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0acb6c05-05a1-4335-a079-959ad65e00b6_1428x743.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_s30!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0acb6c05-05a1-4335-a079-959ad65e00b6_1428x743.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_s30!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0acb6c05-05a1-4335-a079-959ad65e00b6_1428x743.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div></li></ol><p>Days like today are never easy, and I know many of you are feeling pressure. Welcome to the stock market! 😂 If you stick around a long enough time, days like today will happen occasionally, and you will just kind of shrugh. But difficult markets are exactly why having a plan matters. We have had a really profitable last 3 years (since 2022, through the meltup), and now, even though I still think the blow off top is in play, price action is dictating that we protect capital. Lets not lose those years of profits.</p><p>Despite today’s weakness, many of our positions either held their ground, and a few even went up. That said, there are a few that we cannot ignore the warning signals. A few positions I am locking in profits, particularly ahead of earnings; and exiting a few that are clearly demonstrating weakness. </p><p>Below, I am share which positions I am selling, which I’m holding and where I am choosing to just sit on my hands. I have also included reasoning for those decisions. Of course, if you have questions you can <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/aacf7a91-137e-4de3-83cc-b4cec090639e\">Talk to me in the main chat (click here)</a> during market hours. </p><h4><strong>Here are my positions updates: </strong></h4>",
